<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DPL Inc raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DPL Inc raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hilliard Lyons analyst David Burks said he raised DPL Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- He said he considers DPL, the holding company for Dayton Power and Light, attactive on the basis of historical earnings gains, an estimated above average earnings growth rate, and expected consistent dividend growth.</p>
<p>-- DPL shares were up 1/4 at 24-1/2.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
